§ TIER-1 DOMAIN DETERMINATIVES (Egyptian model)
I> silent classifiers: disambiguate category, 0 semantic load
I> cost: 1 glyph → save 5-10 tokens of context disambiguation
| glyph | domain             | example                          |
|-------|--------------------|----------------------------------|
| §     | system/module      | §render, §physics, §audio        |
| ∫     | field/continuous   | ∫density, ∫temperature, ∫flow    |
| ⊞     | spatial/discrete   | ⊞voxel, ⊞chunk, ⊞grid           |
| ⟨ ⟩   | entity/property    | ⟨health⟩, ⟨pos⟩, ⟨vel⟩          |
| ⌈ ⌉   | constraint/bound   | ⌈max:1024⌉, ⌈fps≥60⌉            |
| ⟦ ⟧   | formula/equation   | ⟦F=ma⟧, ⟦∇²φ=ρ⟧                 |
| « »   | external/API       | «wgpu», «vulkan», «tokio»        |
| ⟪ ⟫   | temporal/phase     | ⟪init⟫, ⟪tick⟫, ⟪shutdown⟫      |

§ TIER-1 TYPE SUFFIXES (determinative, ASCII)
I> postfix on identifiers → disambiguate without context
I> use when ambiguity exists; silent-default when unambiguous
| suffix | type              | example                          |
|--------|-------------------|----------------------------------|
| 'd     | data/value        | hp'd = "hp (a data value)"       |
| 'f     | function/process  | render'f = "render (a function)" |
| 's     | system/module     | physics's = "physics (a system)" |
| 't     | type/category     | Material't = "Material (a type)" |
| 'e     | entity/instance   | player'e = "player (an entity)"  |
| 'm     | material/substance| iron'm = "iron (a material)"     |
| 'p     | property/attribute| density'p = "density (a prop)"   |
| 'g     | gate/condition    | alive'g = "alive (a bool gate)"  |
| 'r     | rule/constraint   | max_hp'r = "max_hp (a rule)"     |

